### Vesting Schedule
- **Standard**: 4-year vesting with 1-year cliff
- **Monthly vesting** after cliff (1/48 per month)
- **Acceleration**: Double-trigger on change of control

### Equity Refresh Program
- Annual grants based on performance
- Target refresh: 25% of initial grant annually
- Top performers: Up to 50% of initial grant
- Below expectations: No refresh

